{%- comment -%}
  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ .gh-reveal IS THE FLOOR. It reads as a div with a heading in it. It is    │
  │ the ground the two Chums stand on.                                        │
  │                                                                           │
  │ Its negative top margin tucks the dome under their feet. Its domed        │
  │ radius is the threshold they stand at. Its bottom padding clears the      │
  │ 128px that .gh-edge pulls itself up by, so the stepped teeth bite UP      │
  │ into the pink instead of riding across the copy.                          │
  │                                                                           │
  │ None of the three is spacing. Change one and the characters float.        │
  │                                                                           │
  │ tests/hero-threshold.test.mjs asserts all three and says why on fail.     │
  │                                                                           │
  │ This banner used to lock the pink gummy scroll sequence, signed off       │
  │ 11 Sep 2026. That sequence was removed on 11 Oct 2026 because it          │
  │ juddered on a phone. --zoom-k, --rise-end and .gh-pin .gh-gummy no        │
  │ longer exist, and tests/locked-hero.test.mjs is now inverted to           │
  │ assert it stays gone.                                                     │
  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} GummyChums homepage — coming-soon vibe, pink-forward, scroll fall-in kept {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
{{ 'section-gc-home.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="gc-home">

  <!-- ACT 1 -->
  <header class="gh-stage" id="gh-stage">
    <div class="gh-pin" id="gh-pin" data-idle-pause>

      {%- comment -%} the Chums, flanking the wordmark — brand book v2 {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        ALL THREE Chums, one per SKU. For a long time this showed only two while
        the section directly below announced "three chums" — the page argued with
        itself, and the sleep Chum was simply missing from her own brand's hero.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gh-feet" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="gh-chum gh-chum--l" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="{{ 'gc2-chum-brain.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="340" height="894" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" draggable="false">
      </div>
      <div class="gh-chum gh-chum--c" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="{{ 'gc2-chum-sleep.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="407" height="1031" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" draggable="false">
      </div>
      <div class="gh-chum gh-chum--r" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="{{ 'gc2-chum-eye.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="371" height="984" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" draggable="false">
      </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gh-mid">
        <span class="gh-eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow }}</span>
        <img class="gh-logo" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" src="{{ 'gc-wordmark-stack.png' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="680" height="254" draggable="false" oncontextmenu="return false">
        <h1 class="gh-tag">{{ s.headline | replace: '[', '<mark>' | replace: ']', '</mark>' }}</h1>
        <p class="gh-sub">{{ s.sub }}</p>
        <div class="gh-cta">
          <a class="gc-btn" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ s.cta }}</a>
          <a class="gh-cta2" href="/pages/story">Why gummies? <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="gh-scroll">SCROLL ↓</div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        The carton's inside flap, on the page: a pixel heart over "Hey, chum!".

        This was three kolams and it read as clip art. A kolam is ONE connected
        lattice — a dot grid with a single unbroken line looping through all of
        it — so three copies of one four-petal motif was never a kolam, it was
        three flowers in a row, and the faint pulli looked like dirt on the pink.

        The heart is the mark the pack actually uses here, it is built from
        square cells like the stepped teeth just below it, and there is one of
        it instead of three.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gh-reveal gc-halftone{% unless s.show_greeting %} gh-reveal--slim{% endunless %}">
        {%- if s.show_greeting -%}
        <div class="gh-thresh">
          <div class="gh-thresh__mark gc-rise" aria-hidden="true">
            {% render 'gc-pixel-heart', tone: '--c-surface', size: 72 %}
          </div>
          {%- if s.reveal_title != blank -%}
            <h2 class="gh-thresh__line">{{ s.reveal_title }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if s.reveal_sub != blank -%}
            <p class="gh-thresh__sub">{{ s.reveal_sub }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  {%- comment -%}
    The book's stepped border, at the hero's bottom edge. Until now this was a
    ruler-straight cut from the full-screen pink to the cream — the hardest
    boundary on the page and the one place the motif was most obviously missing.
    Tinted cherry so the pink steps down into the section below, the same way
    the purple steps out of the story panel.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign gh_edge = 'hero-out' -%}
  <div class="gh-edge">{% render 'gc2-dissolve', id: gh_edge, tone: '--c-bg' %}</div>

  <!-- ACT 2 — meet the Chums: the homepage's shop. Scrolling down rides sideways
       through the three; each card is the Chum AND its product. Order runs
       morning -> screen hours -> night. The Chum-to-product pairing is our read,
       not yet Priyal's (NOTES R6.3) — swap the p1/p2/p3 lines if she says so. -->
  {%- assign p1 = all_products['brain-booster-gummies'] -%}
  {%- assign p2 = all_products['eye-care-gummies'] -%}
  {%- assign p3 = all_products['melatonin-gummies'] -%}
  <section class="gh-hs" id="gh-hs">
    <div class="gh-hs-pin" id="gh-hs-pin">
      <div class="gh-hs-track" id="gh-hs-track">
        <div class="gh-hs-intro" id="shop">
          <h2 class="gh-hs-title">Meet our <em>Chums</em></h2>
          <p class="gh-hs-hint">Three chums · one a day</p>
        </div>
        <article class="gh-hs-card" style="--hs-tone:var(--c-mango);--hs-ink:var(--c-mango-deep);--hs-soft:var(--c-mango-soft)">
          <span class="gh-hs-badge gc-sticker">Focus</span>
          <div class="gh-hs-media">
            <span class="gh-hs-shot">
              {%- if p1.featured_image -%}
                {{ p1.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', width: 800, height: 800, alt: '', class: 'gh-hs-photo' }}
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="gh-cluster">
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g1">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-mango', id: 'hs1a' %}</span>
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g2">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-mango', id: 'hs1b' %}</span>
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g3">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-mango', id: 'hs1c' %}</span>
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <img class="gh-hs-fig" src="{{ 'gc2-chum-brain.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="A Chum reading a Brain Boosting book" width="340" height="894" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false">
          </div>
          <h3 class="gh-hs-name"><a href="{{ p1.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ p1.title | default: 'Brain Booster Gummies' }}</a></h3>
          <p class="gh-hs-line">Big brain energy, tiny gummy.</p>
          <p class="gh-hs-meta">30 gummies · one a day</p>
          <div class="gh-hs-buy">
            {% render 'gc-price', price: p1.price %}
            {%- if p1.available -%}
              <span class="gh-hs-cta">View product <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="gh-hs-cta gh-hs-cta--out">Sold out</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="gh-hs-card" style="--hs-tone:var(--c-orange);--hs-ink:var(--c-orange-deep);--hs-soft:var(--c-orange-soft)">
          <span class="gh-hs-badge gc-sticker gc-sticker--right">Eye care</span>
          <div class="gh-hs-media">
            <span class="gh-hs-shot">
              {%- if p2.featured_image -%}
                {{ p2.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', width: 800, height: 800, alt: '', class: 'gh-hs-photo' }}
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="gh-cluster">
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g1">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-orange', id: 'hs2a' %}</span>
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g2">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-orange', id: 'hs2b' %}</span>
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g3">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-orange', id: 'hs2c' %}</span>
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <img class="gh-hs-fig" src="{{ 'gc2-chum-eye.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="A Chum scrolling on their phone" width="371" height="984" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false">
          </div>
          <h3 class="gh-hs-name"><a href="{{ p2.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ p2.title | default: 'Eye Care Gummies' }}</a></h3>
          <p class="gh-hs-line">For screen-tired eyes.</p>
          <p class="gh-hs-meta">30 gummies · one a day</p>
          <div class="gh-hs-buy">
            {% render 'gc-price', price: p2.price %}
            {%- if p2.available -%}
              <span class="gh-hs-cta">View product <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="gh-hs-cta gh-hs-cta--out">Sold out</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="gh-hs-card" style="--hs-tone:var(--c-cherry);--hs-ink:var(--c-cherry);--hs-soft:var(--c-cherry-soft)">
          <span class="gh-hs-badge gc-sticker">Sleep</span>
          <div class="gh-hs-media">
            <span class="gh-hs-shot">
              {%- if p3.featured_image -%}
                {{ p3.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', width: 800, height: 800, alt: '', class: 'gh-hs-photo' }}
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="gh-cluster">
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g1">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-cherry', id: 'hs3a' %}</span>
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g2">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-cherry', id: 'hs3b' %}</span>
                  <span class="gh-g gh-g3">{% render 'gc-gummy', tone: '--c-cherry', id: 'hs3c' %}</span>
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <img class="gh-hs-fig" src="{{ 'gc2-chum-sleep.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="A Chum with an iced coffee, eyes closed" width="407" height="1031" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false">
          </div>
          <h3 class="gh-hs-name"><a href="{{ p3.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ p3.title | default: 'Melatonin Gummies' }}</a></h3>
          <p class="gh-hs-line">Wind down. Sleep tight, Chum.</p>
          <p class="gh-hs-meta">30 gummies · one a day</p>
          <div class="gh-hs-buy">
            {% render 'gc-price', price: p3.price %}
            {%- if p3.available -%}
              <span class="gh-hs-cta">View product <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="gh-hs-cta gh-hs-cta--out">Sold out</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ACT 4 — FAQ -->
  {%- if s.show_faq -%}
  <section class="gh-sec" id="gc-faq" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="gc-wrap">
      <div class="gh-head gc-rise">
        <p class="gc-kick">Good to know</p>
        <h2>Questions, answered.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="gh-faq gc-rise">
        <details class="gh-q"><summary>How many do I take a day?</summary><p>One gummy a day, any time that suits you. Your daily chum is waiting — no water, no pills, no fuss.</p></details>
        <details class="gh-q"><summary>Is there added sugar?</summary><p>No added sugar. Just the good stuff, in a gummy you’ll actually look forward to.</p></details>
        <details class="gh-q"><summary>How long until I feel a difference?</summary><p>Wellness is a habit, not a switch. Most Chums take theirs daily for 4–6 weeks to feel the difference. Consistency is the whole point.</p></details>
        <details class="gh-q"><summary>How fast is delivery?</summary><p>We ship pan-India via Shiprocket. Orders are usually delivered in 3–10 working days, and you’ll get tracking as soon as it leaves us.</p></details>
        <details class="gh-q"><summary>What if I don’t like it?</summary><p>Tell us. Write to us within the return window on your order and we’ll sort it out — see our {% if shop.refund_policy != blank %}<a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">refund policy</a>{% else %}refund policy{% endif %} for the full details.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if s.show_end -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    ACT 5 — the closing ask.

    Every other colour change on this page steps in and out through the pixel
    teeth. This band had neither, so a vivid rectangle was cut into the cream
    with two hard horizontal lines and read as a banner pasted on top of the
    page rather than as part of it. It gets the same treatment as everything
    else: teeth entering at the top, teeth leaving at the bottom.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign end_in = 'end-in' -%}
  {%- assign end_out = 'end-out' -%}
  <section class="gh-end gc-rise gc-halftone">
    <div class="gh-end__in" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'gc2-dissolve', id: end_in, tone: '--c-bg' %}</div>
    <div class="gc-wrap">
      <h2>{{ s.end_title | replace: '[', '<em>' | replace: ']', '</em>' }}</h2>
      <p>{{ s.end_sub }}</p>
      <a class="gc-btn" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ s.end_cta }}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="gh-end__out" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'gc2-dissolve', id: end_out, tone: '--c-bg' %}</div>
  </section>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>


{% schema %}
{
  "name": "GummyChums Home",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Hero" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow chip", "default": "✦ Wellness, but make it fun" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "headline", "label": "Headline (use [ ] to highlight)", "default": "Not another [supplement] brand." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sub", "label": "Subline", "default": "We’re making healthy habits feel good." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta", "label": "CTA label", "default": "Shop the flavours →" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reveal_title", "label": "Threshold line", "default": "Hey, chum!" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reveal_sub", "label": "Threshold sub", "default": "We’re glad you found us." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Flavours" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shop_kicker", "label": "Kicker", "default": "Three flavours ✦ one happy habit" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shop_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Meet the three." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shop_sub", "label": "Sub", "default": "Supplements you’ll actually look forward to." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Blocks" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_greeting", "label": "Show the greeting on the pink band", "default": true, "info": "Off keeps the band \u2014 the Chums stand on it \u2014 but makes it a slim colour step instead of a full screen." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_faq", "label": "Show the FAQ here", "default": true, "info": "Off if you place the standalone FAQ section further down." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_end", "label": "Show the closing CTA here", "default": true, "info": "Off if you place the standalone Closing CTA section last." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Closing" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "end_title", "label": "Title (use [ ] for pink)", "default": "Your daily chums are [waiting]." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "end_sub", "label": "Sub", "default": "Three flavours. One happy habit. Start today." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "end_cta", "label": "CTA", "default": "Grab all three →" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "GummyChums Home" }]
}
{% endschema %}
